                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Hauntingly beautiful story, exquisitely immersive atmosphere.\n\nStupid combat. Those are animals, not Cthulhu minions, they should not be so aggressive.\n\nStupid traversal. Whoever's idea was it to have you platform in a half-ton diving suit? Even Bioshock 2 never asked that of you, and big daddy in that game actually could move!\n\nStupid ice. Don't touch the stupid ice on the ceiling and floor...",
